 anorexia  nervosa.</b></font></p><div><br/>Healthy BMI range: 18.5 - 25 kg/m<sup>2</sup></div><p><b>The result above is not a diagnosis</b></p></div>\n<div id=\"clear\"></div>\n<script>\n\nfunction popMenu(inval, insubmit){\n\n\thtmlVal = \"\";\n\n\tif (inval == \"metric\"){\n\n\t\thtmlVal = htmlVal + \"<li><a href=\\\"#\\\" onclick=\\\"popMenu('standard',1);return false;\\\">US Units</a></li> <li id='menuon'><a href=\\\"#\\\" onclick=\\\"popMenu('metric',1);return false;\\\">Metric Units</a></li> <li><a href=\\\"#\\\" onclick=\\\"popMenu('other',0);return false;\\\">Other Units</a></li>\";\n\n\t\tdocument.getElementById(\"ctype\").value=\"metric\";\n\n\t\tdocument.getElementById(\"standardheightweight\").style.display = 'none';\n\n\t\tdocument.getElementById(\"metricheightweight\").style.display = 'block';\n\n\t\thtmlVal = \"<ul>\" + htmlVal + \"</ul>\";\n\n\t\tdocument.getElementById(\"ucframe\").innerHTML =\"\";\n\n\t\tif (insubmit==1) document.calform.submit();\n\n\t}else if (inval == \"standard\"){\n\n\t\thtmlVal = htmlVal + \"<li id='menuon'><a href=\\\"#\\\" onclick=\\\"popMenu('standard',1);return false;\\\">US Units</a></li> <li><a href=\\\"#\\\" onclick=\\\"popMenu('metric',1);return false;\\\">Metric Units</a></li> <li><a href=\\\"#\\\" onclick=\\\"popMenu('other',0);return false;\\\">Other Units</a></li>\";\n\n\t\tdocument.getElementById(\"ctype\").value=\"standard\";\n\n\t\tdocument.getElementById(\"standardheightweight\").style.display = 'block';\n\n\t\tdocument.getElementById(\"metricheightweight\").style.display = 'none';\n\n\t\thtmlVal = \"<ul>\" + htmlVal + \"</ul>\";\n\n\t\tdocument.getElementById(\"ucframe\").innerHTML =\"\";\n\n\t\tif (insubmit==1) document.calform.submit();\n\n\t}else{\n\n\t\thtmlVal = document.getElementById(\"topmenu\").innerHTML ;\n\n\t\tdocument.getElementById(\"ucframe\").innerHTML = \"<iframe src=\\\"/converter/converter.php?type=\\\" style=\\\"overflow:hidden;width:100%\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"238\\\" frameborder=\\\"NO\\\" scrolling=\\\"NO\\\" allowTransparency=\\\"true\\\" ></IFRAME>\";\n\n\t}\n\n\tdocument.getElementById(\"topmenu\").innerHTML = htmlVal;\n\n}\n\npopMenu(\"standard\",0);\n\n</script>\n<p>Low BMI or body weight is just one physical feature of anorexia. Not all low BMI or body weight is related to anorexia. More information about anorexia is available at <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anorexia_nervosa\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anorexia_nervosa</a>.</p>\n<br/><p><fieldset><legend>Related</legend><a href=\"/bmi-calculator\">BMI Calculator</a> | <a href=\"/body-fat-calculator\">Body Fat Calculator</a> | <a href=\"/ideal-weight-calculator\">Ideal Weight Calculator</a></fieldset><p>\n<h2>Reference</h2>\n\n1. <a href=\"/pdf/cj41l021.pdf\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">CDC weight chart for boy between age 2 and 20</a><br/>\n\n2. <a href=\"/pdf/cj41l022.pdf\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">CDC weight chart for girl between age 2 and 20</a>\n</p></p>"}